  "raw_text": "Call Transcript: User: ... Agent: I'm here to collect information about your food preferences to complete the onboarding so you can get rewarded. To start, please say your name or Prolific ID. User: ... Agent: Please tell me your name or Prolific ID so we can begin. User: 35E63C40867949CA66 Agent: Thank you. What is your favorite fast-food item, including the chain and the exact item? And why do you like it? User: . I'm probably a McDonald's Big Mac and I just like the Big Mac sauce and it's the perfect amount of vegetables to meat and cheese ratio. Agent: That's great to hear. What are the top two or three things that make the Big Mac \"perfect\" for you? User: The Big Mac sauce, the sesame seed bun, and the amount of cheese. Agent: Okay, that makes sense. On the flip side, what are the top two or three things that would make a Big Mac \"bad\" for you? User: If it wasn't seasoned correctly, if there wasn't enough cheese, Agent: And what would be the third thing that would make it bad? Us",
